{
  "_doc": [
    "~/.config/based/omniroute-routing.json — declarative routing metadata",
    "for infrastructure/omniroute/apply-routing.sh. Prefer generating it:",
    "  ./infrastructure/omniroute/apply-routing.sh --seed",
    "writes the live gateway state here, and --dry-run then proves a zero",
    "diff. Keys starting with _ are ignored.",
    "",
    "aliases: bare model id -> target. Three target shapes:",
    "  'my-combo'          a combo by name (validated against the gateway)",
    "  'combo/my-combo'    same, explicit",
    "  'provider/model-id' pin to one upstream (passed through unvalidated)",
    "",
    "mappings: request-pattern -> combo. Mapping rules BEAT aliases, so keep",
    "patterns narrow: a pattern must only cover families the combo can serve,",
    "or every request comes back HTTP 200 carrying the wrong model. The script",
    "warns when no combo member matches the pattern's family — read those.",
    "priority is optional, default 100."
  ],
  "aliases": {
    "my-model": "my-combo",
    "my-model-exact": "provider/upstream-model-id"
  },
  "mappings": [
    { "pattern": "my-model-*", "combo": "my-combo", "priority": 100 }
  ]
}
